ontextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m017-0395","start":395,"end":396,"surface":"卿","kind":"person","person_id":"lxk_xeh_f6r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m017-0406","start":406,"end":407,"surface":"卿","kind":"person","person_id":"lxk_xeh_f6r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m017-0413","start":413,"end":415,"surface":"張唐","kind":"person","person_id":"lxk_xeh_f6r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m017-0420","start":420,"end":422,"surface":"孺子","kind":"person","person_id":"xcr_p13_j7x_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-071-chugan","book_id":"b-shiji-071","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-071-chugan"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:p018","text":"行有日，甘羅謂文信侯曰：「借臣車五乘，請為張唐先報趙。」文信侯乃入言之於始皇曰：「昔甘茂之孫甘羅，年少耳，然名家之子孫，諸侯皆聞之。今者張唐欲稱疾不肯行，甘羅說而行之。今願先報趙，請許遣之。」始皇召見，使甘羅於趙。趙襄王郊迎甘羅。甘羅說趙王曰：「王聞燕太子丹入質秦歟？」曰：「聞之。」曰：「聞張唐相燕歟？」曰：「聞之。」「燕太子丹入秦者，燕不欺秦也。張唐相燕者，秦不欺燕也。燕、秦不相欺者，伐趙，危矣。燕、秦不相欺無異故，欲攻趙而廣河閒。王不如齎臣五城以廣河閒，請歸燕太子，與彊趙攻弱燕。」趙王立自割五城以廣河閒。秦歸燕太子。趙攻燕，得上谷三十城，令秦有十一。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m018-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"甘羅","kind":"person","person_id":"xcr_p13_j7x_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m018-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"文信侯","kind":"person","person_id":"kn3_k3k_rqr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m018-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"張唐","kind":"person","person_id":"lxk_xeh_f6r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m018-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"文信侯","kind":"person","person_id":"kn3_k3k_rqr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m018-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"始皇","kind":"person","person_id":"sas_4gz_ch0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m018-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"甘茂","kind":"person","person_i